# {{senseid|en|Q1008}} The [[Ivory Coast]], {{place|en|country|r/West Africa|a=a}}.

====Usage notes====
* The country has historically been known in [[English]] as ''Ivory Coast'', and corresponding translations in other languages. In October 1985 the government requested that the country be known as Côte d'Ivoire in every language. Read more at [[w:Côte d'Ivoire#Names|Wikipedia]].

